{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/07ff583f695617767d7a555ef65fe42d.webp?t=1770012178\" width=736 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform Anomaly </strong>\u2014 is a cooperative horror game designed to play with friends. Dark places, strange phenomena, and tension that can at any moment turn into laughter await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.poster.avif?t=1770012178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.webm?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.mp4?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers several modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard </strong>\u2014 cooperate with your team and explore the surroundings to find and mark dangerous anomalies. Be careful: nothing here is as simple as it seems, and the slightest mistake can cost you the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek </strong>\u2014 one player becomes the \u201chider\u201d, places anomalies on the map, and watches as others try to find them. Everything here depends on your cunning and ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/070972743459984b79ff02aea8a55d6a.poster.avif?t=1770012178\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/070972743459984b79ff02aea8a55d6a.webm?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to search for and mark anomalies: strange areas of the map with distorted geometry or textures, unusual sounds, and abnormal object behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/3ab642eab13a74100d45fb5796d31b8b.poster.avif?t=1770012178\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/3ab642eab13a74100d45fb5796d31b8b.webm?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> If players correctly mark all anomalies, they will be able to move to the next station alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/2731ea486e868a4bb03094dd8175b8d1.poster.avif?t=1770012178\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/2731ea486e868a4bb03094dd8175b8d1.webm?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Search for anomalies with your friends \u2014 or hide them yourself and watch their attempts to find them,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>it\u2019s a cooperative horror game where fear easily turns into laughter.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.poster.avif?t=1770012178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.webm?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.mp4?t=1770012178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981970?t=1770012178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981970?t=1770012178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/62021dbc95f1d8205f016850d4f5b34604774246/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770012178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/62021dbc95f1d8205f016850d4f5b34604774246/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770012178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4019310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981970/extras/07ff583f695617767d7a555ef65fe42d.webp?t=1770012178\"